  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_010 (0.5199 accuracy) is better than config_005 (0.5070). This experiment tests replacing transformer aggregation with avgpool while keeping scgpt RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, and weighted fusion (similar to config_010). Avgpool is simpler and cheaper than transformer, so this clarifies if accuracy can be maintained with lower cost. It balances exploration of aggregation methods and exploitation of config_010's promising components. Expected cost: ~2.5-3 GPU hours (lower than config_005's 3.95)."
}

